@BookAPI_HostAddress = https://localhost:7103

### 1. Authors Endpoints

### Get All Authors (Paginated, Search & Sorting)
GET {{BookAPI_HostAddress}}/api/authors?PageNumber=1&PageSize=10&SearchTerm=George&SortBy=name&SortDescending=false
Accept: application/json

### Search Authors
GET {{BookAPI_HostAddress}}/api/authors/search?searchTerm=Orwell&pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Get Author By ID
GET {{BookAPI_HostAddress}}/api/authors/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
Accept: application/json

### Create Author
POST {{BookAPI_HostAddress}}/api/authors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "George Orwell",
  "bio": "English novelist, essayist, journalist, and critic."
}

### Update Author
PUT {{BookAPI_HostAddress}}/api/authors/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "George Orwell Updated",
  "bio": "Updated biography details."
}

### Delete Author
DELETE {{BookAPI_HostAddress}}/api/authors/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6


---


### 2. Books Endpoints

### Get All Books (Paginated, Search, Filtering & Sorting)
GET {{BookAPI_HostAddress}}/api/books?PageNumber=1&PageSize=10&SearchTerm=1984&AuthorId=3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6&SortBy=price&SortDescending=true
Accept: application/json

### Get Book By ID
GET {{BookAPI_HostAddress}}/api/books/7e24a180-2a44-42b3-a1d2-0056972621a1
Accept: application/json

### Create Book
POST {{BookAPI_HostAddress}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "1984",
  "isbn": "978-0451524935",
  "description": "A dystopian social science fiction novel.",
  "price": 14.99,
  "stock": 100,
  "authorId": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
  "publishedAt": "1949-06-08T00:00:00Z"
}

### Update Book
PUT {{BookAPI_HostAddress}}/api/books/7e24a180-2a44-42b3-a1d2-0056972621a1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "1984 - Collector's Edition",
  "isbn": "978-0451524935",
  "description": "Updated dystopian classic description.",
  "price": 19.99,
  "stock": 80,
  "authorId": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
  "publishedAt": "1949-06-08T00:00:00Z"
}

### Delete Book
DELETE {{BookAPI_HostAddress}}/api/books/7e24a180-2a44-42b3-a1d2-0056972621a1